WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
A friend seems down. You do not need to fix everything. Listening helps.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:12.000
1. Ask. 'I noticed you seem tired lately. How are you, really?'

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
2. Listen. Do not rush to give advice. Let them finish.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:26.000
3. Say thanks. 'I am glad you told me. You are not alone.'

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:33.000
4. Offer next steps. Offer to go with them to the guidance office, or to call a hotline together.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Keep checking in. If they are in danger, call 911 and tell an adult now.

